544 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project successfully demonstrates a proactive safety mechanism that eliminates standby high-voltage potential on open power sockets. By combining optocoupler-based low-voltage detection with continuous shunt resistor current monitoring, the circuit achieves reliable automatic power delivery only when a genuine load is connected. The system significantly reduces electrocution risks compared to conventional passive socket covers or reactive fault interrupters, offering a robust foundation for next-generation smart outlet safety.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 524 0 R
>>
