/Title (1. Keep 230V AC mains completely disconnected from socket terminals when idle. 2. Maintain a safe, non-lethal 5V DC sensing potential across the socket terminals during standby. 3. Automatically switch to 230V AC only when a valid load loop is completed by plugging in an appliance. 4. Continuously monitor load current during operation and immediately isolate 230V AC as soon as the load)
